			<div class="content" id="post-content-2190361">
									

<p>The -1s and -2s should be changed to SCP-2240-1 and SCP-2240-2, and the interview dialogue sounds a little too casual. In general, interview logs use the word &quot;doc&quot; way too often, your SCP is just the most recent to. Other than that it's not as especially original concept (Dude's being haunted. It's been done.) but it's executed okay. No vote from me.</p>

